{"parse":{"title":"Overclocking Circuit","pageid":383932,"revid":1834122,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Overclocking Circuit</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7f/Talent_Overclocking_Circuit.png/revision/latest?cb=20250730174621\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Overclocking Circuit\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7f/Talent_Overclocking_Circuit.png/revision/latest?cb=20250730174621\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7f/Talent_Overclocking_Circuit.png/revision/latest?cb=20250730174621 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7f/Talent_Overclocking_Circuit.png/revision/latest?cb=20250730174621 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Overclocking Circuit\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Overclocking_Circuit.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Overclocking Circuit.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ineffa\" title=\"Ineffa\">Ineffa</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">If there are thunderclouds created by <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Charged\" title=\"Lunar-Charged\">Lunar-Charged</a> reactions nearby when Birgitta unleashes Discharge attacks, she will initiate an additional attack, dealing <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>AoE Electro DMG</b></span> equal to 65% of Ineffa's <a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a>. This DMG is considered <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Charged\" title=\"Lunar-Charged\">Lunar-Charged</a> DMG.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Direct_Lunar-Charged\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Direct Lunar-Charged\">Direct Lunar-Charged</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Overclocking Circuit</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Ineffa\" title=\"Ineffa\">Ineffa</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Advanced_Properties\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Advanced Properties</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Preview\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Preview</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Advanced_Properties\">Advanced Properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.